WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:09.431
The mind, body and spirit tarot spread is a three-card check-in on
your thoughts, your daily energy and your sense of meaning.

00:00:09.431 --> 00:00:12.044
It is for reflection, not health advice.

00:00:13.344 --> 00:00:14.721
The three positions.

00:00:14.721 --> 00:00:16.374
Mind, body, then spirit.

00:00:17.674 --> 00:00:18.903
How to lay it out.

00:00:18.903 --> 00:00:21.087
Arrange the cards in a triangle.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:26.207
Place card 1, Mind, at the lower left and
card 2, Body, at the lower right.

00:00:27.607 --> 00:00:29.869
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:29.869 --> 00:00:34.457
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
